        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Geography Test Paper</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            max-width: 850px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        .indent {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n        }\n        .image-placeholder {\n            width: 90%;\n            height: 400px;\n            margin: 15px auto 5px auto;\n            border: 1px solid #000;\n            background-color: #f5f5f5;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            color: #333;\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n        .caption {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .question-block {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .question-text {\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .options-row {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n            padding-left: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        .handwritten {\n            font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <p class=\"indent\">沙特阿拉伯第一条双线电气化高铁——麦麦高铁，是我国设计和承建的首条速度达到360千米/时的海外高铁，途经地区沙漠广布、高温缺水。图4为麦麦高铁位置示意图。据此完成9~11题。【认识世界区域+交通主题】</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"image-placeholder placeholder\">\n        [Diagram: Map of Saudi Arabia showing the Mecca-Medina high-speed railway, climate zones, and coordinates, centered]\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">图 4</div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\"><span class=\"handwritten\">B</span>9. 麦麦高铁途经地区主要属于</div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>A. 热带季风气候</div>\n            <div>B. 热带沙漠气候</div>\n            <div>C. 热带草原气候</div>\n            <div>D. 热带雨林气候</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\"><span class=\"handwritten\">D</span>10. 修建麦麦高铁时遇到的困难有</div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>①风沙侵袭</div>\n            <div>②高寒缺氧</div>\n            <div>③高温缺水</div>\n            <div>④昼夜温差大</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>A. ①②③</div>\n            <div>B. ②③④</div>\n            <div>C. ①②④</div>\n            <div>D. ①③④</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\"><span class=\"handwritten\">C</span>11. 麦麦高铁通车后，给当地带来的积极影响有</div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>①方便了人们出行</div>\n            <div>②促进了文化交流</div>\n            <div>③降低了能源运输成本</div>\n            <div>④带动了经济发展</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>A. ①②③</div>\n            <div>B. ②③④</div>\n            <div>C. ①②④</div>\n            <div>D. ①③④</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"indent\">未来20年，中国客机需求量将持续增长。2023年4月，中法两国签署了总价值超过1300亿元人民币的民用飞机订单。法国空客集团将在中国增设工厂。据此完成12~13题。【国际发展与合作主题】</p>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\"><span class=\"handwritten\">D</span>12. 中法两国签署飞机订单属于</div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>A. 文化合作</div>\n            <div>B. 旅游合作</div>\n            <div>C. 教育合作</div>\n            <div>D. 经贸合作</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n        <div class=\"question-text\"><span class=\"handwritten\">A</span>13. 法国空客集团在中国增设工厂的主要原因是中国</div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>①消费市场广阔</div>\n            <div>②技术基础良好</div>\n            <div>③国家政策支持</div>\n            <div>④闲置土地充足</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options-row\">\n            <div>A. ①②③</div>\n            <div>B. ②③④</div>\n            <div>C. ①②④</div>\n            <div>D. ①③④</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        地理试题 第3页（共8页）\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
